[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u3001\u5929\u624D\u306E\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, if it isn\u0027t genius Firis!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9055\u3046\u308F\uFF01\u3000\u5929\u624D\u306F\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\uFF01\n\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2\u30FB\u30D5\u30A9\u30F3\u30FB\u30E9\u30A4\u30F3\u30A6\u30A7\u30D0\u30FC\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wrong! I\u0027m the genius here!\nIlmeria Von Leinweber!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u3092\u3068\u304D\u3081\u304F\u3001\u8D85\u4E00\u6D41\u306E\u5929\u624D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The most brilliant alchemist of our time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5929\u624D\u306F\u3053\u306E\u308F\u305F\u3057\u3082\u3063\uFF01\n\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u30FB\u30DF\u30B9\u30C8\u30EB\u30FC\u30C8\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, I\u0027m the genius!\nFiris Mistlud!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u3092\u3068\u304D\u3081\u304F\u3001\u8D85\u4E00\u6D41\u306E\u5929\u624D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The most brilliant alchemist of our time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u771F\u4F3C\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I keep telling you to stop copying me~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u306F\u306F\u306F\u306F\u306F\u306F\uFF01\n\u3053\u308A\u3083\u9762\u767D\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u5091\u4F5C\u3060\u306D\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahahahahahaha!\nThis is hilarious...! What a show...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5642\u306B\u306F\u805E\u3044\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3042\u3093\u305F\u305F\u3061\u304C\u82B8\u4EBA\u3068\u3057\u3066\n\u5927\u4EBA\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3082\u9837\u3051\u308B\u308F\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u3042\u306F\u306F\u306F\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d heard rumors, but now I see why you two became\nsuch popular comedians...! Ahahahah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7B11\u3044\u3059\u304E\u3088\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re laughing too much!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\u305A\u3063\u3068\u3053\u306E\u8ABF\u5B50\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u6C17\u4ED8\u3044\u305F\u3089\u306A\u305C\u304B\u82B8\u4EBA\u3068\u3057\u3066\u4EBA\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s been like this the whole time...\nBefore we knew it, we somehow got popular as comedians...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3044\u3001\u3044\u3084\u3001\u4F55\u3082\u60B2\u89B3\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u306A\u3044\u305E\u3002\n\u304B\u308F\u3063\u2026\u2026\u3001\u69D8\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306E\u3060\u304B\u3089\u306A\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...W-well, there\u0027s nothing to be ashamed of.\nYou both look... quite natural at it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3075\u3075\u3001\u6BB5\u3005\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306B\n\u8FD1\u3065\u3044\u3066\u304D\u305F\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3082\u3001\u307E\u305F\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u306E\u3088\u306D\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heehee, it\u0027s so cute how Firis has\nstarted to act more and more like Ilmeria~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u307E\u3055\u304B\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1\u306E\u601D\u308F\u306C\u3068\u3053\u308D\u306B\n\u3053\u3093\u306A\u30D3\u30FC\u30C3\u30B0\u306A\u30E9\u30A4\u30D0\u30EB\u82B8\u4EBA\u304C\u73FE\u308C\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Who would have thought such big-time rival\ncomedians would appear in a place like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u65B0\u4E16\u4EE3\u304C\u767B\u5834\u3057\u3066\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1\u306F\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3088\uFF01\n\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u4EBA\u3092\u7B11\u9854\u306B\u3055\u305B\u308B\u3063\u3066\u6700\u9AD8\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3060\u3082\u3093\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027m so happy to see a new generation emerge!\nAfter all, making people smile is the greatest thing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E8C\u4EBA\u306E\u606F\u306E\u5408\u3063\u305F\u82B8\u306F\u7F8E\u3057\u3044\u308F\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3044\u3064\u304B\u79C1\u306E\u821E\u53F0\u3078\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u4E0A\u304C\u3063\u3066\u307F\u306A\u3044\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your perfectly synchronized performance is beautiful...\nWould you like to appear on my stage sometime?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C7\u30A3\u30AA\u30FC\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u306E\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s not what we\u0027re..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u559C\u3093\u3067\u304A\u4F9B\u3055\u305B\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! We\u0027d be delighted to join you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u30D5\u30A1\u30F3\u7B2C\uFF11\u53F7\u3068\u3057\u3066\u805E\u304B\u305B\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u306E\u3060\u304C\u3001\n\u4E8C\u4EBA\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3044\u3046\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u3067\u30B3\u30F3\u30D3\u306B\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...As your number one fan, I must ask:\nHow did you two end up becoming a duo?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u305D\u308C\u79C1\u3082\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u3084\u3063\u3071\u4E00\u756A\u306E\u30D5\u30A1\u30F3\u3068\u3057\u3066\u305D\u3053\u306F\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u304A\u304D\u305F\u3044\u304B\u3089\u3055",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, I was wondering about that too.\nAs your biggest fan, I really want to know the story"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3082\u305D\u3082\u30B3\u30F3\u30D3\u3063\u3066\u308F\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\n\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3001\u8AAC\u660E\u3057\u307E\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, we\u0027re not really a duo per se...\nbut okay, I\u0027ll explain"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5143\u3005\u308F\u305F\u3057\u306F\u30E9\u30B9\u30C6\u30A3\u30F3\u3068\u3044\u3046\u56FD\u306E\n\u5CA9\u5C71\u306E\u4E2D\u306B\u3042\u308B\u753A\u306B\u4F4F\u3093\u3067\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Originally, I lived in a town within the rocky mountains\nof a country called Flussheim"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u753A\u3068\u5916\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306F\u3042\u308B\u6249\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\n\u9694\u3066\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The town was separated from the outside world\nby a door..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3092\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u5148\u751F\u3068\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF\u3055\u3093\u304C\n\u958B\u653E\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then Master Sophie and Miss Plachta\nhelped open it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3057\u3066\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3092\u304D\u3063\u304B\u3051\u306B\u5916\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u3067\u516C\u8A8D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306B\n\u306A\u308B\u65C5\u3092\u59CB\u3081\u305F\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3068\u51FA\u4F1A\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that\u0027s when I met Firis, who had started her journey\nto become a licensed alchemist in the outside world"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3078\u3047\uFF5E\u3001\u305D\u3093\u306A\u611F\u3058\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3093\uFF1F\u3000\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5F85\u3063\u305F\u3001\u516C\u8A8D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3063\u3066\u4F55\u3055\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh~ So that\u0027s how it happened...\nWait, what\u0027s this about being a licensed alchemist?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30B9\u30C6\u30A3\u30F3\u306F\u516C\u8A8D\u8A66\u9A13\u306B\u5408\u683C\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3068\n\u4E00\u4EBA\u524D\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8A8D\u3081\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In Flussheim, you need to pass the license exam\nto be recognized as a full-fledged alchemist"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u306E\u3067\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u3082\u3001\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3082\u3001\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2\u3082\u5168\u54E1\u3001\n\u8A66\u9A13\u306B\u5408\u683C\u3057\u3001\u516C\u8A8D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3068\u3057\u3066\u8A8D\u3081\u3089\u308C\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie, Firis, and Ilmeria have all passed the exam\nand are officially licensed alchemists"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7B46\u8A18\u8A66\u9A13\u3082\u5B9F\u6280\u8A66\u9A13\u3082\u5927\u5909\u3060\u3063\u305F\u306A\u3041\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u5408\u683C\u767A\u8868\u307E\u3067\u305A\u3063\u3068\u30C9\u30AD\u30C9\u30AD\u3057\u3063\u3071\u306A\u3057\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3088\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Both the written and practical exams were so hard...\nI was so nervous until the results came out..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u61D0\u304B\u3057\u3044\u308F\u306D\u3002\u3082\u3046\u305A\u3063\u3068\u524D\u306E\u3053\u3068\u306A\u306E\u306B\u3001\n\u4ECA\u3067\u3082\u3059\u3050\u306B\u3001\u3042\u306E\u6642\u306E\u7DCA\u5F35\u3092\u601D\u3044\u51FA\u305B\u308B\u3082\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It brings back memories. Even though it was so long ago,\nI can still remember how tense I felt"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u308B\u307B\u3069\u2026\u2026\u56FD\u306E\u8A8D\u53EF\u3092\u53D6\u3089\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3068\u3044\u3046\n\u9762\u3067\u306F\u3001\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u9A0E\u58EB\u3068\u540C\u3058\u306A\u306E\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... So it\u0027s similar to us knights\nin that you need state certification"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u30E9\u30F3\u30BF\u30FC\u30CA\u306B\u306F\u305D\u3093\u306A\u4ED5\u7D44\u307F\u306A\u3044\u3088\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But Lantarna doesn\u0027t have anything like that, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1\u306F\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3089\u9762\u767D\u3044\u3068\u601D\u3046\u3051\u3069\u306A\u3041\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u3053\u305D\u8AB0\u3082\u304C\u9A5A\u304F\u30D3\u30C3\u30B0\u306A\u8A66\u9A13\u5185\u5BB9\u3068\u304B\u3067\u3055\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke thinks it would be interesting if we did!\nMaybe with some really big, surprising exam contents!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DF\u30FC\u30B1",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u306E\u8155\u524D\u2026\u2026\n\u8ABF\u5408\u306E\u624B\u969B\u3084\u7D20\u6750\u306E\u898B\u6975\u3081\u306E\u4E0A\u624B\u3055\u3092\u7AF6\u3046\u3068\u304B\u304B\u3057\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Testing alchemy skills...\nLike judging synthesis technique and material assessment?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u307B\u3046\u304C\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u305F\u3061\u306E\u7DF4\u5EA6\u3082\u4E0A\u304C\u308A\u3001\n\u4ED6\u306E\u8005\u3068\u5207\u78CB\u7422\u78E8\u3067\u304D\u308B\u6A5F\u4F1A\u304C\u5897\u3048\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That would help alchemists improve their skills\nand give them more opportunities to learn from each other"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3080\u3001\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3042\u3063\u305F\u307B\u3046\u304C\u3044\u3044\u306E\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u308F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, you have a point...\nMaybe we should have something like that"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u8A71\u984C\u9038\u3089\u3057\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u8A71\u306B\u4E57\u3063\u304B\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3051\u308C\u3069\u3001\n\u3000\u3088\u304F\u3088\u304F\u8003\u3048\u3066\u307F\u308C\u3070\u8A66\u9A13\u306F\u6709\u7528\u3060\u3068\u601D\u3046\u308F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I was just going along to change the subject, but\nthinking about it, an exam system could be useful)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u2026\u2026\u3093\uFF1F\u3000\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u2026\u2026\u516C\u8A8D\u8A66\u9A13\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3000\u5929\u624D\u2026\u2026\u82B8\u4EBA\u306E\u6255\u62ED\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...Hm? Licensed alchemist... certification exam...\nGenius... getting rid of the comedian image...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u308F\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]